        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: McFarland, USA; The Black Hole\n- People: Niki Caro; Mark Ciardi; Gordon Gray; Christopher Cleveland; Bettina Gilois; Grant Thompson; Antônio Pinto; Gary Nelson\n- Organizations: Walt Disney Productions\n- Topics: American films; film genres; film production roles\n\nFacts:\n- The Black Hole is a 1979 American science fiction film directed by Gary Nelson and produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- McFarland, USA, also known as McFarland, is a 2015 American sports drama film.\n- McFarland, USA was directed by Niki Caro.\n- McFarland, USA was produced by Mark Ciardi and Gordon Gray.\n- McFarland, USA was written by Christopher Cleveland, Bettina Gilois, and Grant Thompson.\n- McFarland, USA features music composed by Antônio Pinto.",
